data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/plan_note_1.md\", \"content\": \"Plan: single dispatch to dev covering the entire mission (greet.py + test_greet.py +\\npassing unittest discover run), since the mission is small and stated as\\nall-or-nothing. Will fetch dev's branch and independently re-run\\n`python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` before accepting, rather than trusting\\ndev's report. If dev's first attempt is incomplete or the test run fails when\\nI reproduce it, will send targeted rework naming exactly what's missing.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

